A||||7||rodmcneill||Leather seatcovers ?||||5||
Z||000000||rodmcneill||03-17-2001||02:18 AM||||I have to say that I think Mr. Mike's leather seat covers look really outstanding and that they improve the looks of any Fiero that I have seen them installed in. I have never owned a car with leather seats and was wondering how comfortable they are in the summer. Do they get as hot as vinyl seat covers? how about those of us that drive in the winter,are they cold? Is leather dressing all that is required to keep them from cracking. I was thinking about the leather seatcovers myself but then decided to stay with the stock seats.||||reg||5
Z||000001||wjluciano||03-17-2001||08:46 AM||||wherer do you get these leather seat covers?||||reg||5
Z||000002||BAM-BAM||03-17-2001||09:44 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.mrmikes.com" TARGET=_blank>www.mrmikes.com</A>    <BR>Peace!||||reg||12
Z||000003||Old Lar||03-17-2001||09:53 AM||||Jump into a leather seat wearing shorts, after the car has been in the summer sun. They get hot. Leather seats, especially Mr. Mikes, look nice.  You should use leather cleaner and conditioner to keep the seats supple.  If the leather dries out, it will crack.||||reg||1
Z||000004||TheFiero64||03-18-2001||09:24 AM||||I've had mine since Jan. I have gone out on cold days and they were not that bad to sit in. They seem to warm up when you sit for a few min. I just came back from the NEFA meeting at Kick Hill Farms last night. The seats were like sitting in heaven. They smell nice too.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A><p>[This message has been edited by TheFiero64 (edited 03-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000005||Monkeyman||03-18-2001||12:23 PM||||Mr. Mikes has electric seat heaters.||||reg||1
Z||000006||Tryxalon||03-18-2001||04:18 PM||||I've tried leather seats on everything from the "rich Corinthian leather" on a Volare to BMW's, Mercedes, Cadillacs, Jaguars, even an Aston-Martin DB4. <P>Give me cloth seats or even a cheap set of "genuine simulated pseudo sheep skin"!!! <P>And I never wear shorts!! ... Just cannot stand leather seats ... and vinyl is worse.  <P>I'll cover the seat in my clothes and drive nude before I'll own leather seats!! <BR>(Ewwww! that IS "sick")   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> ||||reg||6
Z||000007||Ed||03-18-2001||10:11 PM||||I like my Mr. Mikes leather.  Even in the heat of central California.||||reg||1
